From 0a64ce035fffd45acf9ee9519c80f4d02894c55e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rory Axton <roryaxton@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:33:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] 0904 redfin: Adreno 620 bring-up (A650-family GMU, HFI
 v2, lito addresses)

sweet_a6xx.h/.c select the GPU with A6_GPU_ID (620 here; 618 and 640 keep
their values, including the ones sunfish 0129-0148 had made unconditional):
- lito addresses: GPU 0x3d00000, GPUCC 0x3d90000, kgsl-smmu 0x3da0000,
  RSCC 0x3de0000 (its own block on the A650 family), chip id 0x06020000,
  panel buffer 0xa0000000; GCC ddrss_gpu_axi back at 0x71154, plus the
  gpucc hlos1_vote_gpu_smmu clock lito's SMMU and GMU nodes vote.
- SMMU: DT masks (GMU <5 0x400>, GPU <0 0x401>) with a fall back to the
  exact SID if the SMR does not read back, the SMR count from IDR0 (lito
  has 5), no sunfish attach-impl-defs, GMU SID 4 routed as on sunfish.
- GMU: kgsl's A650-family VMA (DTCM at 0x10004000; the cache window
  memory comes from a650_gmu.bin's own PREALLOC_REQ blocks, mapped from
  the pool), zero-size firmware blocks skipped, RSC sequencer words of the
  A650 family, PDC TCS addresses from cmd-db (mx/cx/xo, vrm.soc command 3
  on the A620), cmd-db at lito's fixed 0x80860000, veto_fal10, kgsl's
  4-queue HFI table with its priorities.
- HFI v2 tables: the five redfin levels (275/400/500/625 MHz), bandwidth
  table with lito's CN0/MC0/SH0/ACV addresses from cmd-db.
- hw_init for the A620 (kgsl a6xx_start + DT): GMEM 512 KB, hang cycles
  0x3ffff, prim fifo 0x10000 + TSE skip off, UCHE_CLIENT_PF 1, bicubic
  weights, UBWC 3 with highest bank bit 14, CP_APRIV_CNTL, a650_sqe.fw.
- a620_zap.mdt/.b02 into pil_gpu_region 0x8bc15400.
- Kernel present blit: Mesa FD620's magic registers, RB_CCU_CNTL for one CCU.
sweet_gpu.c: default sweetgpufreq=3 (500 MHz); the GPU buffer pool skips
kregistry_mem (0xc8000000) and the log trail at 0xe2000000.
SweetAccelerator: Adreno 620 device info for Turnip (chip 0x06020000,
512 KB GMEM, hbb 14, UBWC 3).

Sources: LineageOS android_kernel_google_redbull lineage-22.2
(drivers/gpu/msm adreno-gpulist.h, adreno_a6xx.c, adreno_a6xx_gmu.c,
kgsl_gmu.c, kgsl_hfi.c; lito-gpu.dtsi, gcc-lito.c, gpucc-lito.c), the
phone's live DT and firmware (recon), Mesa 85fda3b3 freedreno_devices.py.
Not run on the phone yet.

